<title>Singapore: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 23.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Dec 23.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   116/118   123/125     UNQ     238/241</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  126/127   132/135   231/245   255/262</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Healthy demand countered weaker crude to leave Singapore bunkers steady, traders said on Monday. Cargoes also held steady. Demand came from non-Japanese buyers, as Japan was closed for a holiday, and some stragglers ahead of the Christmas break. But supplies were seen healthy from December onwards, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-0870-3082)</p>
